      ],
      "source": "https://www.okhistory.org/publications/enc/entry?entry=MA024"
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "text": "Historic Sanborn fire insurance maps provide a visual record of Marietta's downtown and industrial buildings from 1898 to 1914.",
